          "cost": {
            "gold": 6000,
            "ore": 10,
            "wood": 10
          },
          "description": "Recruits living Sump Reclaimers. Single-target clamp reach crosses exactly one clear intermediate hex; adjacent attacks use ordinary retaliation.",
