            "gold": 12000,
            "ore": 15,
            "sulfur": 8,
            "wood": 10
          },
          "description": "Recruits massive living chemtech-augmented human Chem-Golems. These two-hex fighters walk into ordinary single-target melee with normal retaliation; no automatic regeneration, repair or artillery.",
